==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sanosuke Sagara (Enemy)|Sanosuke Sagara]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] handily outranges every enemy here, and can be used to whittle down both the boss and the supporting threats with good enough meatshielding.

